{
    "title": "Homes.com for Sale & Rent",
    "description": "Homes.com: Homebuying as it should be.  \r\n\r\nHassle Free Search. Co-shopping made easy. In-depth neighborhood and school data\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nExperience homebuying how it should be on the fastest growing site in the industry \u2013 designed for homebuyers and agents.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHomebuyers  \r\n\r\nWith the Homes.com app you\u2019ll have access to homes for sale and rent, easy access to the listing agent\u2019s contact information, the most detailed information about neighborhoods and schools, a robust directory to find qualified buyer agents specializing in your search, mortgage calculators, home value estimates from 4 sources, historical photos, and the most advanced collaboration tools around to easily co-shop with friends, family and the agent you choose to work with.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAgents\r\n\r\nHomes.com helps agents provide best-in-class service, build their brand and streamline their business. Homes Pro is built as extension to Homes.com to provide free tools to agents to collaborate with clients in one central place.   \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe tools included in Homes Pro help agents provide exceptional service that help guide homebuyers to finding their next home. Agents can easily manage their leads, collaborate with clients, and review feedback in real time. Agents can also share listings directly to their social media platforms and create CMAs for home buyers and sellers directly from Homes.com.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nA redefined Agent Directory allows agents to showcase their expertise and attract new clients by showcasing listing history, volume sold and specific areas that they focus on. An agent\u2019s profile showcases even more with a detailed bio, awards, photos, videos and so much more to stand out to homebuyers.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHere\u2019s an at a glance view of what the Homes.com App offers for agents and homebuyers:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Find Homes for Sale and Rent: Browse real estate listings for sale across the U.S. including Foreclosures and New Construction sourced directly from the MLS\u2019s and their data providers.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Map Search: Find nearby homes with the GPS driven location finder. Quickly zoom and navigate neighborhoods with interactive maps.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Current and Historical listing Photos: Get a detailed look at a property and see how its changed over time* (note at bottom \u2013 when available)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Estimate your monthly payments with our Mortgage Calculator: Utilize our built-in Mortgage Calculators for help understanding the true cost of the home.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Everything you need to know about neighborhoods and schools: \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n      o Our dedicated team of in-house researchers and photographers have partnered with some of the most-trusted sources, interviewed local experts, and personally explored the     \r\n\r\n         areas to curate the most detailed neighborhood overviews available anywhere to simplify your search.\r\n\r\n         \r\n\r\n          Nearby schools and rankings from Niche and Great Schools\r\n\r\n          \u2022 Parks and recreation\r\n\r\n          \u2022 Walk scores and public transit\r\n\r\n          \u2022 Restaurants and coffee shops\r\n\r\n          \u2022 Churches\r\n\r\n          \u2022 Farmers Markets, festivals and other social events\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Collaborate and co-shop Like Never Before:\r\n\r\n             o    Free yourself from the chaos of email, text, PDF attachments, and missed phone calls. Agents and homebuyers can actively work to review feedback in real time, trade notes   \r\n\r\n                 on homes and add a co-shopper to find the right home together.\r\n\r\n             o    Agents can provide best in class service and work with homebuyers directly on the site they are searching  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Exclusive Agent Features on Homes Pro\r\n\r\n      o Collaborate, build your brand and manage your leads in one central location to provide exceptional service.  \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\u2022 Connect with clients to power their search\r\n\r\n    \u2022 Gain real-time client search insights and respond promptly\r\n\r\n    \u2022 Create CMA\u2019s in minutes  \r\n\r\n    \u2022 Streamline your communications  \r\n\r\n    \u2022 Share listings on social  \r\n\r\n    \u2022 Build your brand with an enhanced agent profile",
    "descriptionHTML": "Homes.com: Homebuying as it should be.  <br><br>Hassle Free Search. Co-shopping made easy. In-depth neighborhood and school data<br><br> <br><br>Experience homebuying how it should be on the fastest growing site in the industry \u2013 designed for homebuyers and agents.<br><br> <br><br>Homebuyers  <br><br>With the Homes.com app you\u2019ll have access to homes for sale and rent, easy access to the listing agent\u2019s contact information, the most detailed information about neighborhoods and schools, a robust directory to find qualified buyer agents specializing in your search, mortgage calculators, home value estimates from 4 sources, historical photos, and the most advanced collaboration tools around to easily co-shop with friends, family and the agent you choose to work with.  <br><br> <br><br>Agents<br><br>Homes.com helps agents provide best-in-class service, build their brand and streamline their business. Homes Pro is built as extension to Homes.com to provide free tools to agents to collaborate with clients in one central place.   <br><br> <br><br>The tools included in Homes Pro help agents provide exceptional service that help guide homebuyers to finding their next home. Agents can easily manage their leads, collaborate with clients, and review feedback in real time. Agents can also share listings directly to their social media platforms and create CMAs for home buyers and sellers directly from Homes.com.<br><br> <br><br>A redefined Agent Directory allows agents to showcase their expertise and attract new clients by showcasing listing history, volume sold and specific areas that they focus on. An agent\u2019s profile showcases even more with a detailed bio, awards, photos, videos and so much more to stand out to homebuyers.  <br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Here\u2019s an at a glance view of what the Homes.com App offers for agents and homebuyers:<br><br> <br><br>\u2022 Find Homes for Sale and Rent: Browse real estate listings for sale acros